@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

state InitialState
InitialState --> ServiceCenterHome : LOGIN_AND_DESTINATION_SELECTED

ServiceCenterHome : entry / Logged in Service Center
ServiceCenterHome : do / Display journey details

state JourneyDetails
JourneyDetails : entry / Viewing journey details
JourneyDetails : do / Allow user to activate driving mode or choose other options

state DrivingMode
DrivingMode : entry / Activated driving mode
DrivingMode : do / Enable navigation and tracking

state Accident
Accident : entry / Detected accident
Accident : do / Inform relevant authorities and send notifications

state EatingPlaceSelection
EatingPlaceSelection : entry / User is hungry
EatingPlaceSelection : do / Allow user to select a place to eat

state PlaceToEat
PlaceToEat : entry / Viewing selected eating place
PlaceToEat : do / Display menu and allow ordering

state Feedback
Feedback : entry / Upon completion of journey
Feedback : do / Allow users to provide feedback

ServiceCenterHome --> JourneyDetails : VIEW_JOURNEY_DETAILS
JourneyDetails --> DrivingMode : ACTIVATE_DRIVING_MODE
DrivingMode --> Accident : ON_ACCIDENT
Accident --> ServiceCenterHome : REPORT_ACCIDENT
JourneyDetails --> EatingPlaceSelection : SELECT_PLACE_TO_EAT
EatingPlaceSelection --> PlaceToEat : VIEW_MENU_AND_ORDER
PlaceToEat --> Feedback : COMPLETE_JOURNEY
Feedback --> ServiceCenterHome : RECEIVE_FEEDBACK

state ExpiryNotification
ExpiryNotification : entry / To view expiry notification
ExpiryNotification : do / Send service request to Car owner
ServiceCenterHome --> ExpiryNotification : EXPIRY_NOTIFICATION
ExpiryNotification --> ServiceCenterHome : RETURN_TO_SERVICE_CENTER_HOME

state Entering Damaged parts list
Entering Damaged parts list : entry / To enter Damaged parts list
Entering Damaged parts list : do / Preparing and entering damaged parts list
ServiceCenterHome --> Entering Damaged parts list : ENTER_DAMAGED_PARTS_LIST
Entering Damaged parts list --> ServiceCenterHome : RETURN_TO_SERVICE_CENTER_HOME

state Updating parts Information
Updating parts Information : entry / To update changed parts information
Updating parts Information : do / Update Information
ServiceCenterHome --> Updating parts Information : UPDATE_PARTS_INFORMATION
Updating parts Information --> ServiceCenterHome : RETURN_TO_SERVICE_CENTER_HOME

state Logout
Logout : entry / To Logout
Logout : do / Logout
ServiceCenterHome --> Logout : LOGOUT
Logout --> ServiceCenterHome : LOGGED_OUT_SUCCESSFULLY

TERMINAL_STATE --> [*] : COMPLETION_EVENT
@enduml
